cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Yggdrasil — an interactive tree of the plant kingdom"
message: >-
  If you use this software or its data, please cite it. If you redistribute the
  data, please also credit the upstream sources listed in DATA-LICENSE — Kew's
  WCVP and the Jin & Qian (2022) megatree in particular, whose CC BY terms this
  data inherits.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Oddur
    family-names: Sigurdsson
    email: oddurs@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/oddurs/kingdom"
url: "https://yggdrasil.oddurs.com"
abstract: >-
  An interactive visualisation of the classification of land plants: 479
  families and 14,135 accepted genera, sized by accepted-species richness,
  coloured by lineage, and dated to geological time. The backbone follows APG IV
  and PPG I; species counts and native distributions come from Kew's World
  Checklist of Vascular Plants; divergence ages are crown estimates computed as
  the MRCA of each clade's tips in the GBOTB.extended dated megatree, with
  outlier tips rejected. Ships as a single self-contained HTML file with no
  runtime dependencies, alongside a static page for every family and order.
keywords:
  - plant taxonomy
  - tree of life
  - phylogeny
  - data visualisation
  - APG IV
  - PPG I
  - WCVP
  - botany
license: MIT
license-url: "https://github.com/oddurs/kingdom/blob/main/LICENSE"
references:
  - type: article
    title: >-
      An update of the Angiosperm Phylogeny Group classification for the orders
      and families of flowering plants: APG IV
    authors:
      - name: The Angiosperm Phylogeny Group
    year: 2016
    doi: 10.1111/boj.12385
  - type: article
    title: >-
      A community-derived classification for extant lycophytes and ferns (PPG I)
    authors:
      - name: The Pteridophyte Phylogeny Group
    year: 2016
    doi: 10.1111/jse.12229
  - type: article
    title: "V.PhyloMaker2: an updated and enlarged R package for generating large phylogenies for vascular plants"
    authors:
      - family-names: Jin
        given-names: Yi
      - family-names: Qian
        given-names: Hong
    year: 2022
  - type: database
    title: "World Checklist of Vascular Plants (WCVP)"
    authors:
      - name: "Royal Botanic Gardens, Kew"
    url: "https://powo.science.kew.org/about-wcvp"
